, and stronger performance that lasts long after the workout or workday ends.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","accordion_page":"","padding_bottom":0}},"divider_nXHFHc":{"type":"divider","settings":{"show_line":true,"padding_bottom":0}},"product_accordion_GN4cjT":{"type":"product_accordion","settings":{"show_description":false,"show_read_more":false,"open_by_default":false,"enable_full_width":false,"tabs_bg_color":"","show_accordion_divider":false,"line_thickness":"normal","accordion_heading":"Benefits","heading_style":"font-heading","accordion_text":"<ul><li>Supports healthy testosterone production and male vitality<\/li><li>Promotes sustained energy, stamina, and physical performance<\/li><li>Helps improve focus, drive, and cognitive clarity<\/li><li>Aids in recovery and stress resilience through adaptogenic support<\/li><li>Encourages hormonal balance and cellular renewal<\/li><li>Provides antioxidant and anti-inflammatory protection<\/li><li>Helps maintain endurance and performance during physical and mental exertion<\/li><\/ul>","accordion_liquid":"","accordion_page":"","padding_bottom":0}},"divider_DTrdrU":{"type":"divider","settings":{"show_line":true,"padding_bottom":0}},"product_accordion_PMFRX8":{"type":"product_accordion","settings":{"show_description":false,"show_read_more":true,"open_by_default":false,"enable_full_width":false,"tabs_bg_color":"","show_accordion_divider":false,"line_thickness":"normal","accordion_heading":"How To Use","heading_style":"font-heading","accordion_text":"<p>Take one sachet daily, ideally in the morning or before training, to power strength, stamina, and focus throughout the day.<br\/>Tear open one sachet and mix it with 200 mL of water, or add it to your favourite drink, smoothie, or juice. Stir or shake well until fully dissolved and enjoy.For best results, use consistently for 12 weeks to experience visible performance and vitality benefits.<\/p>","accordion_liquid":"","accordion_page":"","padding_botto